[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Point the agent at its server in %%ETCDIR%%/agent.env, then:

  sysrc woodpecker_agent_enable=YES
  service woodpecker_agent start

The agent uses the local backend: pipeline steps run on this host as the
%%WOODPECKER_USER%% user, with the tools installed here. A step's "image:"
names the shell its commands run in (sh, bash) or, for a plugin, the
binary to run. Install what pipelines need (gmake, node, ...) as packages.
EOM
}
]
